  m_text: Slime Rancher is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file.
    When "slime_rancher.apworld" is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking
    START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to "Options Creator" to
    create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who
    will host the AP Multiworld.
