  m_text: "When you click \"START SETUP\" in the \"SETUP\" tab, oribf.apworld will
    be installed and moved into the \"custom_worlds\" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. \nBepInEx will then be downloaded into the Ori BF core files,
    along with the required mod folder, which will be placed in Ori DE\\BepInEx\\plugins.
    Then 'BepInEx.cfg' config file will be created with the 2 required options enabled."
