  m_text: Slime Rancher 2 is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world
    file. When "slime_rancher_2.apworld" is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder
    (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to "Options
    Creator" to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the
    person who will host the AP Multiworld.
