  m_text: 'When you start the mods setup, BepInEx and the Archipelago mods folder
    will be downloaded into the Subnautica core directory. The game will then launch
    and automatically close after a few seconds to ensure BepInEx is correctly initialized.


    If
    the ''Use Non VR command on start'' is enabled, the game will force Steam to
    launch Subnautica in non-vr mode (if you have SteamVR).'
