  m_text: "You have 2 revert options, both can't be enabled at the same time.\n\nIf
    you use the \"Clear AP Mods\" option it will only delete the mods that are required
    for Nine Sols Archipelago.\n\nIf you use the \"Full Clear BepInEx\" option it
    will delete everything related to BepInEx and mods. If other mods are detected
    an additionnal confirmation will appear.\n\t"
