  m_text: When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, slime_rancher_2.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. BepInEx & dotnet will then be installed into the game's core
    folder. The required AP Mod's DLLs will be installed inside the BepInEx\Mods
    directory.
