      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new "Archipelago Connection" window should
    appear in the main menu.


    In "Enter Username...", enter the name assigned
    to your YAML file.


    In the "Enter IP..." field, enter archipelago.gg: followed
    by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after
    creating a new room.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did
    not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally, click "Connect" and then, you can
    start a new run!'
