  m_text: DREDGE is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When
    "dredge.apworld" is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP),
    boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to "Options Creator" to create your .yaml
    file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.
