      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new "AP Client" window should appear on the
    left side of your screen in PowerWash Simulator.


    In the "Address:port"
    field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that
    you can find on the website after creating a new room.


    The "Password" field
    is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    In "Slot", enter
    the name assigned to your YAML file.


    Finally, click "Connect" and then,
    you can start a new run!'
