  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, go into Options and it should open in the ''Archipelago''
    tab.


    In the "Address:Port" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the
    port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating
    a new room.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one,
    leave it blank.


    In "Slot name", enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    Finally,
    click "ARCHIPELAGO CONNECT" and then you can start playing!


    You can also
    change some options on this tab.'
