  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, go into Options and you should be able to see
    a new "PLUGIN CONFIG" button as the first option. Click ''CONFIGURE'' on the
    Archipelago mod. There, you will be able to change a few settings, to connect,
    go to ''PLAYER SETTING''.


    In "NAME", enter the name assigned to your YAML
    file.


    In the "ADDRESS" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port.
    This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new
    room.


    The "PASSWORD" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave
    it blank.


    Finally, click "CONNECT" and then you can start playing!


    You
    can also change some options on this tab.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
