  m_text: "Once everything is set up, launch the game and once in the main menu,
    press 'F10'.\n\nType \"connect archipelago.gg:XXXXX [slotname]\"\n\nXXXXX is
    the room\u2019s port. You can find this number on the website after creating
    a new room.\n\n\"[slotname]\" is the name assigned to your yaml file.\n\nFinally,
    press enter and you can start a new run!"
