  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, RE7 Framework windows will appear. The default
    key to manually open the windows should be ''INSERT'' but you can change it in
    the Configuration tab.


    In the Archipelago Client for REFramework window:

    In
    the "Host" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit
    number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.


    In Slot",
    enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    The "Password" field is optional.
    If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally, click the Connect
    button and then, you can start a new run!'
