      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, launch ''StardewModdingAPI.exe (you also can
    start it automatically by enabling launch option for the setup). Once in the
    game, make a new run.


    In the "Server" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed
    by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after
    creating a new room.


    In "Slot", enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    The
    "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally,
    click "OK" and then you can start playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
