      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You have 2 revert options, both can''t be enabled at the same time.


    If
    you use the "Clear AP Mods" option it will only delete the mods that are required
    for RoR 2 Archipelago.


    If you use the "Full Clear BepInEx" option it will
    delete everything related to BepInEx and mods. If other mods are detected an
    additionnal confirmation will appear.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
