  m_text: "When you click \"START SETUP\" in the \"SETUP\" tab, cloverpit.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the \"custom_worlds\" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. \nBepInEx will be installed into the game's core folder.
    The AP Mod files will be installed inside the BepInEx\\plugins directory."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
