  m_text: 'When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, balatro.apworld will
    be installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. Lovely''s version.dll will then be installed into the game''s
    core folder. Then Steamodded & BalatroAP will be downloaded in AppData\Roaming\Balatro\Mods.

    Lovely''s
    mod folder will only be created in the Mods directory after booting up the game
    using the version.dll file.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -9134737203265703719, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
