  m_text: "Once the Archipelago is set up and that you downpatched, click \"START
    GAME\", select a fresh new save and click the Archipelago option.\n\nIn the \"Server
    URL\" field, enter archipelago.gg. \n\nIn \"Server Port\" enter the room's port.
    This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new
    room.\n\nThe \"Password\" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave
    it blank.\n\nFinally, click \"START\" and you can start playing!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
