  m_text: When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, portal2.apworld will be
    installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago Launcher
    directory. The Portal2ArchipelagoMod folder will be installed into steamapps\sourcemods.
    After Steam restarted, there should be a new game in the Library called "Portal
    2 Archipelago Mod".
