  m_text: When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, hades.apworld will be
    installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago Launcher
    directory. The ModInstaller will then be downloaded into the game's core folder.
    You will need to give Admin access to the tool so it can start the Installer.
    If you don't want to, simply go find and run it manually inside the Hades core
    directory. The installer will install all required folders, change a few scripts
    and more...
