  m_text: "Once everything is set up and that the WotW Randomizer app is open. Click
    the 3 dots icon (next to the 'Settings'), go to 'Play Archipelago'.\n\nIn the
    \"Server Address & Port\" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port.
    This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new
    room.\n\nIn \"Player/Slot name\", enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe
    \"Password\" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally,
    you can click \"LAUNCH\" start a new run and it should connect you!\n\t"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -9134737203265703719, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
