  m_text: "When you click \"START SETUP\" in the \"SETUP\" tab, clair_obscur.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the \"custom_worlds\" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. \nThe AP Mod folder will then be downloaded into the game's
    core files.\nDownloading the mods will place them inside already existing folders
    but it can be reverted (check revert infos)."
