  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new "Archipelago" window should appear in
    the top-left corner of your screen in TUNIC. You will be able to choose between
    a casual randomizer or an Archipelago, we will select the Archipelago option.
    To edit the connection infos, click ''Edit Connection Info''.


    In "Player",
    enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    Select ''archipelago.gg'' (or
    ''localhost'') in the "Host" field.


    In "Port", enter the room''s port which
    is a 5-digit number that can be found on the website after opening a room.


    The
    "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally,
    click "Connect" and start a new run!


    You can also change some AP settings!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
