  m_text: 'When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, slime_rancher.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. MelonLoader will then be installed into the game''s core
    folder. The  required folder and .dll will be installed inside the BloonsTD6\Mods
    directory and the UserLibs folder will be created with all its content.

    Only
    the Mods and the UserLibs folder will be created automatically, the other ones
    will be created after starting the game.'
