  m_text: 'You have 2 revert options, both can''t be enabled at the same time.


    If
    you use the "Clear AP Mods" option it will only delete the mods that are required
    for Balatro Archipelago.


    If you use the "Full Clear" option it will delete
    everything related to Lovely, Steamodded and mods. If other mods are detected
    an additionnal confirmation will appear.'
