      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u2022 Example 2: Some games (usually Unreal games) are using a console
    that will appear once the AP Mod is loaded and that you press a given key.\ne.g.
    On Voices of the Void, a new console window will appear when pressing 'F10' where
    you will be able to type the server infos.\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t"
