  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new Archipelago window in the top-left corner
    after the game''s intro.


    In the "Host" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed
    by the port, this is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after
    creating a new room.


    In "Slot Name", enter the name assigned to your YAML
    file.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave
    it blank.


    Finally, click "Connect" and then, you can start a new run!'
