  m_text: When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, cluster_truck.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. BepInEx, the unstripped folder containing required DLLs will
    be downloaded into Clustertruck's root directory. The mods (AP Mod and a dependency
    mod) will be downloaded into BepInEx\plugins.
