      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new window should appear in the main menu
    in the bottom-right corner.


    In "Slot Name", enter the name assigned to
    your YAML file.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did not set
    one, leave it blank.


    In the "Host" field, enter "archipelago.gg".


    In
    the "Port" field, enter the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find
    on the website after creating a new room. The default value should be "-1", you
    need to replace it.


    Finally, click "Connect" and then you can start playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
