  m_text: "You have 3 revert options, using Full Clear will disable the other 2 until
    you turn it off.\n\nIf you use the \"Clear AP Mods\" option it will only delete
    the mods that are required for RE7 AP Client.\n\nIf you use the \"Full Clear\"
    option it will delete everything related to REFramework and mods. If other mods
    are detected an additionnal confirmation will appear.\n\t"
