  m_text: "\u2022 Example 1: Some games (usually Unity games) have a built-in connection
    window that will appear once the AP Mod is loaded.\ne.g. On Subnautica, a new
    window will appear in the main menu where you will be able to enter the server
    infos.\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
