  m_text: 'When installing their APWorld, some games will generate a new client and
    in most of these cases the client will be the thing that you will have to use
    to connect your game to the multiworld.

    e.g. when downloading hitman_woa.apworld
    a new "HITMAN World of Assassination Client" can be found on the Launcher after
    restarting it.'
