  m_text: "Once everything is set up, start a NEW \"Story\" mode save.\n\nOnce in-game,
    press ESCAPE, then, F10 and type \"connect archipelago.gg:XXXXX [slotname]\"\n\nXXXXX
    is the room\u2019s port. You can find this number on the website after creating
    a new room.\n\n\"[slotname]\" is the name assigned to your yaml file.\n\nFinally,
    press enter and you should see a few messages appear on the right-side of your
    screen saying that you're connected or, that there was an error."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
