  m_text: "Once everything is set up, (re)start the Archipelago Launcher and you
    should be able to find a new 'Hades Client'. Do NOT open Hades through Steam,
    it won't load the mods, you need to open the Hades Client. Once you open the
    client, it will open a file exlorer window, you will need to go find your Hades
    directory and find \"StyxScribe.py\", open it and Hades should launch itself.
    \n\nOnce Hades is open, go back to the Hades Client on the AP Launcher and connect
    there, after that, you can start playing!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
