  m_text: 'Celeste (Open World) is an Archipelago core game, meaning it does not
    require a custom world file (.apworld).

    Because of this, aside from installing
    the mods, all you need to do is create your YAML file using the "Options Creator"
    in the AP Launcher and send it to the person hosting the AP multiworld.'
