  m_text: "Once everything is set up, a new \"Archipelago\" window should appear
    in the top-left corner of your main menu.\n\nIn the \"Address\" field, enter
    archipelago.gg. \n\nIn \"Port\" enter the room's port. This is a 5-digit number
    that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nThe \"Password\"
    field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nIn \"Slot\",
    enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nFinally, click \"Connect\" and
    then, you can start a new run!"
