  m_text: PowerWash Simulator is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world
    file (powerwashsimulator.apworld). When the apworld is downloaded in the Archipelago
    Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to
    "Options Creator" to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send
    it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.
