    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Once everything is set up, open the DS3-Archipelago folder inside you
    game's folder. First, you'll need to run \"DS3Randomizer.exe\" (inside 'randomizer').
    \n\nIn the \"Room URL\" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port, this
    is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nIn
    \"Player name\", enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe \"Password\"
    field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, press
    'Load' and you can go to the next step.\n\nMake sure you aren't offline on Steam,
    and start \"launch-ds3.bat\".\n\n/!\\ MAKE SURE THAT YOU ARE OFFLINE ON DARK
    SOULS 3 BEFORE STARTING /!\\\n"
