  m_text: "When you click \"START SETUP\" in the \"SETUP\" tab, another_crab.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the \"custom_worlds\" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. \nBepInEx will then be downloaded into the ACT core files,
    along with the required mod DLL, which will be placed in Another Crab's Treasure\\BepInEx\\plugins.
    Then 'BepInEx.cfg' config file will be created with the Logging option enabled."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
