      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Once everything is set up, open the Archipelago website and go to the
    room you have just opened. In the room, you should see a clickable text \"Download
    Patch File\" next to your name. (SEE IMAGE BELOW)\n\nOpen the Archipelago Launcher
    again and now that minecraft.apworld has been installed, you should be able to
    find a new \"Minecraft Client\", open it and you will see a \"Open APMC File\", 
    click it and select the .apmc file you have just downloaded from the Archipelago
    website.\n\nWait until the Server loads correctly and you should see \"Server
    Running\" on top with the Server Address.\n\nBoot up the Minecraft Launcher and
    start Minecraft in version 1.21.11. \nIf you don't already have it, go to Installations,
    New installation and in version select 1.21.11, install it and then start the
    game in the right version.\n\nTo connect, go in Multiplayer and add a new address,
    the address can be found on the Archipelago Minecraft Client. Once you're in,
    open the text chat and type: \"/start\" and you should be able to play!\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
